{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1500215-help-me-decide-on-a-name","id":1500215,"title":"Help me decide on a name?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-12-20T16:06:00-08:00","id":1500215,"title":"Help me decide on a name?","content":"I'm undecided between 3 different vornames and 2 surnames for the NPC I'm creating (it's an antagonist by the way and a German blood mage). As I'm really undecided, and I think any of these could work, I'm asking for help here as my mind has this habit of being stuck on one thing for far too long. So please, what is in your opinion the best combination between the names: Erwin, Erich, Magnus and the surnames: Brandt and Winter.<br /> <br /> I with I knew how to create a poll here lol","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12348-herr-meister","name":"Herr Meister","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12348_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1114"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-20T16:43:01-08:00","id":1500225,"title":"","content":"The obvious best answer is Magnus Erich Winter Erwin Brandt.<br /> <br /> But I get that sort of perfection isn't for everyone, so Magnus Brandt and Erich Winter are the second place winners.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"